      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3338,
      "text": "You were not expecting the Book to be revealed to you, but it was a mercy from your Lord. So never be a supporter to the disbelievers[37].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 28,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَصَصِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qasas",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Stories",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 86,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 396,
      "ruku": 341,
      "hizbQuarter": 158,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3339,
      "text": "Do not let them turn you away from Allah’s verses after they have been sent down to you. Rather, call people to your Lord, and never be among those who associate partners with Allah.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 28,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَصَصِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qasas",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Stories",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 87,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 396,
      "ruku": 341,
      "hizbQuarter": 158,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3340,
      "text": "Do not invoke with Allah another god; none has the right to be worshiped except Him. Everything will perish except His Face[38]. His is the Judgment and to Him you will all be brought back.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 28,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَصَصِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qasas",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Stories",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
