      "page": 396,
      "ruku": 341,
      "hizbQuarter": 158,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3341,
      "text": "Alif Lām Mīm[1].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 29,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَنكَبُوتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ankaboot",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spider",
        "numberOfAyahs": 69,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 396,
      "ruku": 342,
      "hizbQuarter": 159,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3342,
      "text": "Do people think once they say, “We believe,” that they will be left without being put to the test?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 29,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَنكَبُوتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ankaboot",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spider",
        "numberOfAyahs": 69,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 396,
      "ruku": 342,
      "hizbQuarter": 159,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3343,
      "text": "We certainly tested those who came before them. For Allah will surely make known those who are truthful and those who are liars.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 29,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَنكَبُوتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ankaboot",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spider",
        "numberOfAyahs": 69,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 396,
      "ruku": 342,
      "hizbQuarter": 159,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3344,
      "text": "Do the evildoers think that they can escape Us? How evil is their judgment!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 29,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَنكَبُوتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ankaboot",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spider",
        "numberOfAyahs": 69,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 396,
      "ruku": 342,
      "hizbQuarter": 159,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3345,
      "text": "Whoever hopes to meet Allah, the time appointed by Allah is sure to come, and He is the All-Hearing, the All-Knowing.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 29,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَنكَبُوتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ankaboot",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spider",
        "numberOfAyahs": 69,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 396,
      "ruku": 342,
      "hizbQuarter": 159,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3346,
      "text": "Whoever strives, he only strives for his own good. Indeed, Allah is in no need of the worlds.",
      "surah": {
